{"id":"9cf21178fae2ba8e","group":"58","path":"58/batch12/58-df-zfc-set-indexed-intersection.md","title":"ZFC Set Indexed Intersection","display":"df-zfc-set-indexed-intersection — ZFC Set Indexed Intersection","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-set-indexed-intersection","aliases":["58-df-zfc-set-indexed-intersection"],"display":"df-zfc-set-indexed-intersection — ZFC Set Indexed Intersection","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-set-indexed-intersection"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-set-indexed-intersection</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-set-indexed-intersection — ZFC Set Indexed Intersection"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span> (nonempty index set)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> (indexed family function, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> (codomain containing the family members) and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J\">\\(J\\)</span> (indexed intersection)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Function}\">\\(\\operatorname{Function}\\)</span> (function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcSetIndexedIntersectionStructure}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcSetIndexedIntersectionStructure}_S\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcSetIndexedIntersection}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcSetIndexedIntersection}_S\\)</span> (explicit predicate and compatibility projection)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}set\\text{-}indexed\\text{-}intersection\\text{-}explicit} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcSetIndexedIntersectionStructure}_S(J,F,I,C)\\leftrightarrow I\\neq\\varnothing\\land\\mathrm{Function}(F,I,C)\\land\\exists i_0\\in I\\;\\bigl(J\\subseteq F(i_0)\\land\\forall x\\in F(i_0)\\;(x\\in J\\leftrightarrow\\forall i\\in I\\;(x\\in F(i)))\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}set\\text{-}indexed\\text{-}intersection\\text{-}explicit} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcSetIndexedIntersectionStructure}_S(J,F,I,C)\\leftrightarrow I\\neq\\varnothing\\land\\mathrm{Function}(F,I,C)\\land\\exists i_0\\in I\\;\\bigl(J\\subseteq F(i_0)\\land\\forall x\\in F(i_0)\\;(x\\in J\\leftrightarrow\\forall i\\in I\\;(x\\in F(i)))\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}set\\text{-}indexed\\text{-}intersection\\text{-}projection} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcSetIndexedIntersection}_S(J,F,I)\\leftrightarrow\\exists C\\in V\\;\\mathrm{ZfcSetIndexedIntersectionStructure}_S(J,F,I,C)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}set\\text{-}indexed\\text{-}intersection\\text{-}projection} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcSetIndexedIntersection}_S(J,F,I)\\leftrightarrow\\exists C\\in V\\;\\mathrm{ZfcSetIndexedIntersectionStructure}_S(J,F,I,C)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A codomain is supplied before function evaluation, and membership in the intersection is bounded by one witnessed family member, so the defining comprehension is set-sized.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$F$ (indexed family function, see [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Function}$ (function predicate, see [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"I","display":false},{"tex":"F","display":false},{"tex":"C","display":false},{"tex":"J","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcSetIndexedIntersectionStructure}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcSetIndexedIntersection}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}set\\text{-}indexed\\text{-}intersection\\text{-}explicit} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcSetIndexedIntersectionStructure}_S(J,F,I,C)\\leftrightarrow I\\neq\\varnothing\\land\\mathrm{Function}(F,I,C)\\land\\exists i_0\\in I\\;\\bigl(J\\subseteq F(i_0)\\land\\forall x\\in F(i_0)\\;(x\\in J\\leftrightarrow\\forall i\\in I\\;(x\\in F(i)))\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}set\\text{-}indexed\\text{-}intersection\\text{-}projection} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcSetIndexedIntersection}_S(J,F,I)\\leftrightarrow\\exists C\\in V\\;\\mathrm{ZfcSetIndexedIntersectionStructure}_S(J,F,I,C)","display":true}],"bytes":1564,"backlinks":[{"id":"5260a5349d0b732f","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"5ddfe8b261dc66b6","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"371f1df3500cdcfc","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"5f00c1ab9b3cd46a","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3365","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-zfc-set-indexed-intersection.md|58-df-zfc-set-indexed-intersection]]（batch12）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","36d7463d215be751"]}